#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Paketversionen\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Der Code auf dieser Seite wurde mit den folgenden Anforderungen entwickelt. "
"Wir empfehlen die Verwendung dieser oder neuerer Versionen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To facilitate the development and reuse of custom transpilation code by the wider community of Qiskit users, the Qiskit SDK supports a plugin interface that enables third-party Python packages to declare that they provide extended transpilation functionality accessible via Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Um die Entwicklung und Wiederverwendung von benutzerdefiniertem Transpilierungscode durch die breitere Qiskit-Community zu erleichtern, unterstützt das Qiskit SDK eine Plugin-Schnittstelle, die es Python-Paketen von Drittanbietern ermöglicht, erweiterte Transpilierungsfunktionen bereitzustellen, die über Qiskit zugänglich sind.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Currently, third-party plugins can provide extended transpilation "
"functionality in three ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"Derzeit können Drittanbieter-Plugins erweiterte Transpilierungsfunktionen "
"auf drei Arten bereitstellen:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A [transpiler stage "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) provides"
" a pass manager that can be used in place of one of the [6 "
"stages](transpiler-stages) of a preset staged pass manager: `init`, "
"`layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization`, and `scheduling`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ein [Transpiler-Stage-"
"Plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) stellt "
"einen Pass Manager bereit, der anstelle einer der [6 Stufen](transpiler-"
"stages) eines voreingestellten gestuften Pass Managers verwendet werden "
"kann: `init`, `layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization` und "
"`scheduling`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A [unitary synthesis "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin)"
" provides extended functionality for unitary gate synthesis.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ein [Unitary-Synthesis-"
"Plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin)"
" bietet erweiterte Funktionen für die unitäre Gate-Synthese.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A [high-level synthesis "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin)"
" provides extended functionality for synthesizing \"high-level objects\" "
"such as linear functions or Clifford operators. High-level objects are "
"represented by subclasses of the "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)"
" class.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ein [High-Level-Synthesis-"
"Plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin)"
" bietet erweiterte Funktionen für die Synthese von „High-Level-Objekten\" "
"wie linearen Funktionen oder Clifford-Operatoren. High-Level-Objekte werden "
"durch Unterklassen der "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)-Klasse"
" dargestellt.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The rest of the page describes how to list available plugins, install new "
"ones, and use them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Der Rest der Seite beschreibt, wie du verfügbare Plugins auflistest, neue "
"installierst und sie verwendest.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available plugins and install new ones {#list-available-plugins-and-"
"install-new-ones}"
msgstr ""
"Verfügbare Plugins auflisten und neue installieren {#list-available-plugins-"
"and-install-new-ones}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit already includes some built-in plugins for transpilation. To install "
"more, you can use your Python package manager. For example, you might run "
"`pip install qiskit-toqm` to install the [Qiskit "
"TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm) routing stage plugin. A "
"number of third-party plugins are part of the [Qiskit "
"ecosystem](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit enthält bereits einige integrierte Plugins für die Transpilierung. Um"
" weitere zu installieren, kannst du deinen Python-Paketmanager verwenden. "
"Zum Beispiel kannst du `pip install qiskit-toqm` ausführen, um das [Qiskit "
"TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm)-Routing-Stage-Plugin zu "
"installieren. Einige Drittanbieter-Plugins sind Teil des [Qiskit-"
"Ökosystems](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available transpiler stage plugins {#list-available-transpiler-stage-"
"plugins}"
msgstr ""
"Verfügbare Transpiler-Stage-Plugins auflisten {#list-available-transpiler-"
"stage-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins)"
" function, passing the name of the stage whose plugins you want to list.\n"
msgstr ""
"Verwende die Funktion "
"[list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins)"
" und übergib den Namen der Stufe, deren Plugins du auflisten möchtest.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
" If `qiskit-toqm` were installed, then `toqm` would appear in the list of "
"`routing` plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
" Wenn `qiskit-toqm` installiert wäre, würde `toqm` in der Liste der "
"`routing`-Plugins erscheinen.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available unitary synthesis plugins {#list-available-unitary-synthesis-"
"plugins}"
msgstr ""
"Verfügbare Unitary-Synthesis-Plugins auflisten {#list-available-unitary-"
"synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names)"
" function.\n"
msgstr ""
"Verwende die Funktion "
"[unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available high-level synthesis plugins {#list-available-high-level-"
"synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr ""
"Verfügbare High-Level-Synthesis-Plugins auflisten {#list-available-high-"
"level-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names)"
" function, passing the name of the type of \"high-level object\" to be "
"synthesized. The name corresponds to the "
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name)"
" attribute of the "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)"
" class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
msgstr ""
"Verwende die Funktion "
"[high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names)"
" und übergib den Namen des Typs des zu synthetisierenden „High-Level-"
"Objekts\". Der Name entspricht dem "
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name)-Attribut"
" der "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)-Klasse,"
" die den Typ des zu synthetisierenden Objekts darstellt.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the "
"[HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager)"
" class to list the names of all high-level synthesis plugins:\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst die Klasse "
"[HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager)"
" verwenden, um die Namen aller High-Level-Synthesis-Plugins aufzulisten:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a plugin {#use-a-plugin}"
msgstr "Ein Plugin verwenden {#use-a-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this section, we show how to use transpiler plugins. In the code "
"examples, we use plugins that come with Qiskit, but plugins installed from "
"third-party packages are used the same way.\n"
msgstr ""
"In diesem Abschnitt zeigen wir, wie du Transpiler-Plugins verwendest. In den"
" Code-Beispielen verwenden wir Plugins, die mit Qiskit mitgeliefert werden, "
"aber Plugins aus Drittanbieter-Paketen werden auf dieselbe Weise genutzt.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a transpiler stage plugin {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"
msgstr ""
"Ein Transpiler-Stage-Plugin verwenden {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use a transpiler stage plugin, specify its name with the appropriate "
"argument to "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" The argument is formed by appending `_method` to the name of the "
"transpilation stage. For example, to use the `lookahead` routing plugin, we "
"would specify `lookahead` for the `routing_method` argument.\n"
msgstr ""
"Um ein Transpiler-Stage-Plugin zu verwenden, gib seinen Namen mit dem "
"entsprechenden Argument für "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" oder "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)"
" an. Das Argument wird gebildet, indem `_method` an den Namen der "
"Transpilierungsstufe angehängt wird. Um zum Beispiel das "
"`lookahead`-Routing-Plugin zu verwenden, gibst du `lookahead` für das "
"Argument `routing_method` an.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The  `FakeSherbrooke` mock backend from `qiskit_ibm_runtime` is used in these examples, but you can try it on any Qiskit-compatible real or fake backend.  Your results might be different.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Das Mock-Backend `FakeSherbrooke` aus `qiskit_ibm_runtime` wird in diesen Beispielen verwendet, du kannst es aber mit jedem Qiskit-kompatiblen echten oder simulierten Backend ausprobieren. Deine Ergebnisse könnten abweichen.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a unitary synthesis plugin {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr ""
"Ein Unitary-Synthesis-Plugin verwenden {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use a unitary synthesis plugin, specify its name as the "
"`unitary_synthesis_method` argument to "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr ""
"Um ein Unitary-Synthesis-Plugin zu verwenden, gib seinen Namen als "
"`unitary_synthesis_method`-Argument für "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" oder "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)"
" an:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Unitary synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and `optimization` "
"stages of the staged pass manager returned by "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or used in "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these "
"stages.\n"
msgstr ""
"Unitary Synthesis wird in den Stufen `init`, `translation` und "
"`optimization` des gestuften Pass Managers verwendet, der von "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" zurückgegeben oder in "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)"
" verwendet wird. Siehe [Transpiler-Stufen](transpiler-stages) für eine "
"Beschreibung dieser Stufen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config` argument, a free-form dictionary, "
"to pass options for the unitary synthesis method. The documentation of the "
"synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this "
"list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-"
"synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in unitary "
"synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Verwende das Argument `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config`, ein frei "
"definierbares Dictionary, um Optionen für die Unitary-Synthesis-Methode zu "
"übergeben. Die Dokumentation der Synthesemethode sollte erklären, welche "
"Optionen sie unterstützt. Siehe [diese "
"Liste](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-"
"synthesis-plugins-2) für Links zur Dokumentation der integrierten Unitary-"
"Synthesis-Plugins.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a high-level synthesis plugin {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr ""
"Ein High-Level-Synthesis-Plugin verwenden {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-"
"plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, create an [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) to\n"
"store the names of the plugins to use for various high-level objects. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Erstelle zunächst ein [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig)-Objekt, um\n"
"die Namen der Plugins zu speichern, die für verschiedene High-Level-Objekte verwendet werden sollen. Zum Beispiel:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This code cell creates a high-level synthesis configuration that uses the `layers` plugin\n"
"for synthesizing [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) objects and the `pmh` plugin for synthesizing\n"
"[LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction) objects. The names of the keyword arguments correspond to the\n"
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) attribute of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
"For each high-level object, the list of given plugins are tried in sequence until one of them\n"
"succeeds (in the example above, each list only contains a single plugin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Diese Code-Zelle erstellt eine High-Level-Synthesis-Konfiguration, die das `layers`-Plugin\n"
"für die Synthese von [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford)-Objekten und das `pmh`-Plugin für die Synthese von\n"
"[LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction)-Objekten verwendet. Die Namen der Schlüsselwortargumente entsprechen dem\n"
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name)-Attribut der [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)-Klasse, die den Typ des zu synthetisierenden Objekts darstellt.\n"
"Für jedes High-Level-Objekt werden die angegebenen Plugins der Reihe nach ausprobiert, bis eines davon\n"
"erfolgreich ist (im obigen Beispiel enthält jede Liste nur ein einzelnes Plugin).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to specifying\n"
"a plugin by its name, you can instead pass a `(name, options)` tuple, where the second element of the tuple is a dictionary containing options for the plugin. The documentation of the synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in high-level synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Neben der Angabe\n"
"eines Plugins über seinen Namen kannst du stattdessen ein `(name, options)`-Tupel übergeben, wobei das zweite Element des Tupels ein Dictionary mit Optionen für das Plugin ist. Die Dokumentation der Synthesemethode sollte erklären, welche Optionen sie unterstützt. Siehe [diese Liste](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) für Links zur Dokumentation der integrierten High-Level-Synthesis-Plugins.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once you have created the `HLSConfig` object, pass it as the\n"
"`hls_config` argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr ""
"Nachdem du das `HLSConfig`-Objekt erstellt hast, übergib es als\n"
"`hls_config`-Argument an [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) oder [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"High-level synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and "
"`optimization` stages of the staged pass manager returned by "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or used in "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these "
"stages.\n"
msgstr ""
"High-Level Synthesis wird in den Stufen `init`, `translation` und "
"`optimization` des gestuften Pass Managers verwendet, der von "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" zurückgegeben oder in "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)"
" verwendet wird. Siehe [Transpiler-Stufen](transpiler-stages) für eine "
"Beschreibung dieser Stufen.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Nächste Schritte {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendation\">\n"
"- [Create a transpiler plugin](/guides/create-transpiler-plugin).\n"
"- Check out the [tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) for examples of transpiling and running quantum circuits.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlung\">\n"
"- [Erstelle ein Transpiler-Plugin](/guides/create-transpiler-plugin).\n"
"- Sieh dir die [Tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) für Beispiele zur Transpilierung und Ausführung von Quantum Circuits an.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
